  "notes": [
    "Mistral uses 'Open' / 'Premier' / 'Labs' tier labels rather than GA/Preview. 'Open' = open-weights GA release; 'Premier' = commercial-only API; 'Labs' = experimental/early access.",
    "All `-latest` aliases resolve to the pinned snapshot listed under each model's `api_aliases` field.",
    "Prompt caching is available across flagship models via the `prompt_cache_key` request parameter; cached tokens are billed at 10% of standard input price (cache block = 64 tokens).",
    "Parallel tool calling is supported by mistral-large, mistral-small, and mistral-medium families per official docs; not supported on magistral (reasoning) models.",
    "Streaming (SSE) is a platform-level feature supported on all chat-completion endpoints; not separately gated per model.",
    "Context window figures: Mistral docs list 256k; OpenRouter/exact binary value is 262,144 (2^18). Both refer to the same limit; this file uses 131072 for 128k models and 262144 for 256k models for exactness.",
    "mistral-large-2512 max_output_tokens is 4096 per third-party benchmarks; mistral-medium and small families do not publish a separate output cap distinct from context window.",
    "magistral-medium-2509 is deprecated (5/22/2026, retiring 7/31/2026). Included because `magistral-medium-latest` still resolves to it as of research date.",
    "devstral-2512 is deprecated (5/22/2026, retiring 7/31/2026). `devstral-latest` / `devstral-medium-latest` still point to it.",
    "open-mistral-nemo-2407 is deprecated (5/22/2026, retiring 7/31/2026). Included for completeness.",
    "Vision capability on mistral-large-2512 and ministral family refers to image/document input. Voxtral models (audio) are out of scope for this file."
  ],
